  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="15">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wi">Wi</ref> 15</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="15" corresp="#wit-h">Gif þeow ete his sylfes ræde, VI scll' oþþe his hyd.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#oliver" n="11.1" corresp="#wit-h">Gif þeow ete his sylfes ræde, VI scƚƚ oþþe his hyd.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#oliver" corresp="#wit-h">If a slave eats of his own accord, 6 shillings or his hide.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#attenborough" corresp="#wit-h">If a slave eats of his own free will, he shall pay 6 shillings compensation or undergo the lash.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#whitelock" corresp="#wit-h">If a slave eat it of his own accord [he is to pay] six shillings or be flogged.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">wenn ein Sklav [es] isst aus seinem eigenen Entschluss, [büsse er dem Herrn] 6 Schll. oder seine Haut.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">if a slave eats [it] of his own decision, [let him pay his lord] 6 shillings or his hide.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
